### =====================================================================
### Requisições de exemplo — REST Client (VS Code) / HTTP Client (IntelliJ)
### Execute na ordem para percorrer o fluxo completo.
### =====================================================================

@enrollment = http://localhost:8081
@progress = http://localhost:8082
@certificate = http://localhost:8083
@notification = http://localhost:8084

### 1. Catálogo de cursos
GET {{enrollment}}/api/courses

### 2. Criar matrícula (inicia o fluxo -> EnrollmentCreated)
POST {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "aluno-1",
  "studentName": "Maria Silva",
  "studentEmail": "maria@email.com",
  "courseId": "EDA-101"
}

### 3. Progresso criado pelo Progress Service
GET {{progress}}/api/progress/1

### 4a. Concluir aula 1 (-> LessonCompleted)
POST {{progress}}/api/progress/1/lessons/1/complete

### 4b. Concluir aula 2
POST {{progress}}/api/progress/1/lessons/2/complete

### 4c. Concluir aula 3 (-> LessonCompleted + CourseCompleted)
POST {{progress}}/api/progress/1/lessons/3/complete

### 5. Certificado da matrícula
GET {{certificate}}/api/certificates/enrollment/1

### 6. Matrícula (deve estar CERTIFIED)
GET {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments/1

### 7. Notificações do aluno
GET {{notification}}/api/notifications?recipient=maria@email.com

### 8. Nova matrícula para testar cancelamento
POST {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "aluno-2",
  "studentName": "Carlos Souza",
  "studentEmail": "carlos@email.com",
  "courseId": "SPRING-301"
}

### 9. Cancelar matrícula 2 (-> EnrollmentCancelled)
POST {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Mudança de planos"
}

### 10. Tentar concluir aula de matrícula cancelada (409)
POST {{progress}}/api/progress/2/lessons/1/complete

### 11. Validação (400)
POST {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "",
  "studentEmail": "email-invalido",
  "courseId": "EDA-101"
}

### 12. Retry + DLQ: e-mail @falha.com falha no Notification Service
POST {{enrollment}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "aluno-3",
  "studentName": "Joao",
  "studentEmail": "joao@falha.com",
  "courseId": "JAVA-201"
}

### 13. Verificar certificado pelo código (substitua pelo código real)
GET {{certificate}}/api/certificates/CERT-XXXXXXXXXX

### 14. Health check
GET {{enrollment}}/actuator/health
